B.abr=new A.af(B.acn,["SPE Basrah","OK","Cancel","Delete","Retry","Loading...","An error occurred.","No data available.","Open","Download","Search","Settings","Language","English","Arabic","Home","Academic","SPE Lectures","Downloads","Profile","Search for a subject or section...","Academic Stages","Courses, lectures and study materials","SPE Lectures","Workshops and technical sessions","SPE Members","Meet the SPE Basrah chapter members","About SPE Basrah","Learn more about our chapter and platform","Follow Us","Student Educational Platform","Welcome to the SPE Basrah Student Chapter","This educational platform was designed free of charge to serve students of the University of Basra, Department of Oil and Gas Engineering, in cooperation with SPE.","SPE University of Basrah Student Chapter","Could not open this link.","An error occurred while opening the link.","Welcome to","Empowering students, developing leaders, and shaping the future of energy.","Latest Announcements","Latest from Instagram","View All","Read More","No announcements are available yet.","Could not load announcements.","No Instagram posts are available yet.","Could not load Instagram posts.","View post on Instagram","Academic Stages","First Stage","Second Stage","Third Stage","Fourth Stage","First Course","Second Course","Subjects","Study Materials","No study materials are available yet.","Could not load the study materials.","Open Online","Open Offline","Downloading...","Downloaded","The download failed.","Downloads","Search downloads...","You have not downloaded any materials yet.","No downloaded materials match your search.","Delete Download",'Do you want to delete "{title}" from this device?',"The downloaded file was deleted.","Could not delete the downloaded file.","Could not load downloads: {error}","Could not open the file: {error}","Refresh","Clear","{count} Downloads","Available offline \u2022 {date}","More options","Today","Yesterday","{days} days ago","No Downloads Yet","Downloaded study materials will appear here and can be opened without an internet connection.","Offline Downloads Are Available on Mobile","Use the Android or iOS application to download and open study materials offline.","SPE Lectures","No lectures are available yet.","Could not load SPE lectures.","The video link is invalid.","Could not open the video.","Watch Video","Search lectures...","Searching lectures...","No lectures match your search.","SPE Lecture","SPE Members","No SPE members have been added yet.","Could not load SPE members.","Member Details","Member Name","Position","About the Member","Telegram Username","Telegram","Telegram username is not available.","Could not open Telegram.","Role in SPE","Member since","Contact","Notification Settings","Notifications","Receive updates from SPE Basrah","Academic Stage","Choose your current academic stage","Choose your stage to receive relevant materials.","Select Stage","Profile","Language","Notification Settings","About SPE Basrah","Dark Mode","About SPE Basrah","University of Basrah Student Chapter","Instagram","Website","Email","The SPE Basrah Student Chapter is a student branch of the Society of Petroleum Engineers (SPE). It aims to support students academically and professionally by organizing lectures, workshops, and technical events, thereby contributing to the development of their skills and preparing them for the job market.","Based on this objective, the Basra University Chapter has created this educational platform, which we are developing into an academic resource serving students across all four academic years. The platform includes explanations of course materials, lectures, educational videos, and supplementary materials that help students learn in an easy and organized manner.","The platform also includes a section dedicated to SPE Basrah Student Chapter lectures and activities, enabling students to follow the scientific and technical content offered by the chapter and utilize it to enhance their knowledge and skills.","Through this initiative, we strive to provide a comprehensive learning environment that combines academic content with professional activities and their development to support students and enrich their university experience."],t.w)
